The user asks for a deterministic PDDL planner to produce a valid plan that achieves the goal state with minimal number of actions. The domain and problem are quite complex, with many predicates and actions. The goal is:

(and
  (dispatched shift_candidate_alpha)
  (dispatched origin_availability_alpha)
  (dispatched destination_availability_alpha)
  (candidate_staged_for_loading shift_candidate_beta)
