  (candidate_skill_certificate_linked shift_candidate_beta skill_certificate_alpha)
  (compliance_certificate_available compliance_certificate_alpha)
)

We need to produce a plan (list of actions) that achieves this goal, respecting preconditions and effects, using only actions defined in the domain. The plan should be optimal (minimal number of actions). The output must be only the plan, one action per line, no extra text, no empty lines.

We need to figure out a sequence of actions that leads to the goal.

